{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04994","headline":"和杜麟台元志春情 · 沈佺期","name":"和杜麟台元志春情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉树满中园，氛氲罗秀色。\n不见仙山云，倚琴空太息。\n沈思若在梦，缄怨似无忆。\n青春坐南移，白日忽西匿。\n蛾眉返清镜，闺中不相识。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}